<title>USA: TABLE - Forrest City FY97 shr $1.16 vs $1.25.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Forrest City FY97 shr $1.16 vs $1.25.</headline>
<dateline>FORREST CITY, Ark. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>				  1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			     1.16			  1.25</p>
<p> Net		     $  230,145		  $  253,610</p>
<p> Interest on loans    4,149,743		   3,538,601</p>
<p> Loans		   35,505,539		  30,418,821</p>
<p> Assets		  55,800,000		  51,900,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income and EPS are after payment of a one-time assessment of $168,000, or $0.68 per share, to Federal Deposit Insurance Corp.</p>
<p>As of June 30, 1997, the company had 194,677 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Forrest City Financial Corp is parent of Forrest City Bank NA.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
